@startuml
left to right direction
actor "Document owner" as Owner
actor "Selected eligible reviewer" as Reviewer
actor "Replacement task assignee" as Replacement
rectangle "APGC DMS — single-step Memo workflow" {
  usecase "Create / edit draft" as Draft
  usecase "Submit exact version for review" as Submit
  usecase "View assigned pending task" as ViewTask
  usecase "Approve submitted version" as Approve
  usecase "Return submitted version with reason" as Return
  usecase "Revise with note and resubmit new version" as Resubmit
  usecase "Reassign pending task" as Reassign
  usecase "Finalize approved version" as Finalize
  usecase "Archive finalized Memo" as Archive
}
Owner --> Draft
Owner --> Submit
Owner --> Resubmit
Owner --> Finalize
Owner --> Archive
Reviewer --> ViewTask
Reviewer --> Approve
Reviewer --> Return
Replacement --> ViewTask
Owner ..> Submit : selected user must differ
note right of Reviewer
  Selected actor must meet current eligibility:
  active/employed profile with current active
  department and position, or temporary active
  profileless staff compatibility path.
  Task assignment and state—not review_document—
  authorize the decision.
end note
note bottom of Submit
  WorkflowTask.submitted_version is explicit.
  Approve/return decisions stay bound to that version;
  a later current_version change does not retarget them.
end note
note bottom of Reassign
  Requires documents.reassign_workflow_tasks,
  pending task, under-review document, eligible target,
  and a reason.
end note
note bottom of Finalize
  Owner + APPROVED state; output uses approved version.
end note
@enduml
